**PGO13**：kind=`Root-runtime118-original-PG-observation`、schema1，闭13=`kind/schemaVersion/recoveryG1/input/observedAt/bootId/container/image/volume/mount/pgProcess/databases/evidence`。container闭4=`id/running/status/exitCode`；image闭2=`id/digest`；volume闭3=`name/driver/mountpoint`；mount闭4=`source/destination/rw/pgdata`；pgProcess为实际`pid/startTime/startedAt`或未运行时null；databases恰两项闭2=`name/oid`。stopped-before的databases只是原批准映射，须有同原PGDATA实际`PG_VERSION=15`和`base/<OID>`目录证据，明确未SQL验证；after/readiness才实核DB/OID，不能混标。

